{"id":"kolu-nag-count","parent":"kolu-root","ord":"a3","title":"PR: `kolu watch --nag 30m/3` caps the nag #upstream","doing":true,"started":"2026-09-03T07:03:00-04:00","desc":"The human's ruling 2026-09-03 ~07:05 ET, from the kill-before-merge RCA: today `--nag` re-reports a held state forever, and an all-night drip is what tempted the orchestrator to kill parked terminals. RESHAPED on the human's word ~08:50 ET: no separate flag — the cap is an optional count on `--nag` itself, `--nag 30m/3` (every thirty minutes, three reminders after the first report, then quiet until the state changes; a bare `--nag 30m` stays forever). The JSON face says which reminder this is and how many are left. The olai plugin half (`doorbell-nag-count`) reads the same `30m/3` value from `_olai/Kolu.olai`'s `nag` knob once this lands and is bumped. Kolu's own process: /be, then /ci once at fully done, both platforms green; the orchestrator merges. The author was steered mid-lane (PR #2224 open with the earlier flag shape).","created":"2026-09-03T07:02:27-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T08:52:38-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-opencode","brief":"briefs/nag-count.md","dispatched":"2026-09-03T07:10:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-03 ~07:00 ET, ruling on the kill-before-merge RCA: a finite nag, three reminders, stored in Kolu.olai","kolu-terminal":"2f6f4590","merge":"merge-auto","repo":"repo-kolu","tier":"ordinary"}}
